繰り返し 君 と 踊った
I danced with you over and over.

281
00:27:40,155 --> 00:27:42,675
揺れる 景色 道 は 続く
Swaying scenery, the road continues,

282
00:27:42,675 --> 00:27:45,355
通り過ぎる 風 に ふ かれ
blown by the passing wind.

283
00:27:45,555 --> 00:27:48,055
何度も 越え て 行ける から
Because I can cross over time and time again,

284
00:27:48,055 --> 00:27:50,575
境界線 雲 かき分け 手 を 伸ばし た
I parted the clouds and reached out my hand.

285
00:27:50,695 --> 00:27:53,155
涙 は 今 浮かぶ 空 に
Entrusting my tears to the floating sky,

286
00:27:53,155 --> 00:27:55,815
預け て 走り出す の
I start to run.

287
00:27:58,935 --> 00:28:00,715
並ん で 見つめ た
Side by side,

288
00:28:00,715 --> 00:28:02,875
輝く 光 を 手 に
holding the shining light in my hands.

289
00:28:21,935 --> 00:28:25,075
問題 は いつも 自分 次第
The problem is always up to myself,

290
00:28:25,075 --> 00:28:28,235
さあ 未来 を 選ん で
come, choose the future.

291
00:28:29,395 --> 00:28:31,975
こんがらがっ た 糸 ほど い たら
If I untangle the tangled threads,

292
00:28:31,975 --> 00:28:34,455
思いのまま 進 も う
I'll move forward just as I feel.

293
00:28:34,655 --> 00:28:37,115
毎日 冒険 なん だって
Every day is an adventure,

294
00:28:37,115 --> 00:28:39,555
奇跡 は 無限大 なん だって
miracles are infinite.

295
00:28:39,755 --> 00:28:42,575
高鳴る 想い 羅針盤 の ような
My throbbing feelings, like a compass,

296
00:28:42,575 --> 00:28:45,375
今 そっと きっと 導 い て く
will guide me softly and surely now.

297
00:28:52,375 --> 00:28:56,235
そうだ！めぐる めぐる 波 に 乗っかっ て 風 まかせ 君 と 笑っ た
That's right! Riding the spinning waves, leaving it to the wind, I laughed with you.

298
00:28:59,955 --> 00:29:02,595
予想 外 は 想定内
The unexpected is within expectations,

299
00:29:02,595 --> 00:29:05,195
間違い や 失敗 も 楽しん で
enjoying mistakes and failures as well.

300
00:29:05,395 --> 00:29:07,975
一歩 踏み出し たら 見え た 可能性
Stepping forward, possibilities came into view,

301
00:29:07,975 --> 00:29:10,555
行き止まり の 壁 壊し て
breaking down the wall of a dead end.

302
00:29:10,755 --> 00:29:13,475
まだ 知ら ない 世界 君 と 一緒 なら
If I'm with you in a world I don't know yet,

303
00:29:13,475 --> 00:29:16,195
怖く ない よ
I'm not afraid.

304
00:29:16,395 --> 00:29:19,455
わくわく し て いる 今 が 一番 大好き
The present moment, when I'm excited, is what I love most.

305
00:29:56,295 --> 00:29:59,995
ゆっくり 焦らない 自分 の ペース で 行こう
Slowly, don't rush, let's go at our own pace.

306
00:30:00,360 --> 00:30:02,140
どんな大変な事が起きたって
No matter what difficult things happen,

307
00:30:02,140 --> 00:30:04,180
君の足のその下には
right beneath your feet,

308
00:30:04,180 --> 00:30:07,180
とてもとても丈夫な「ばね」が
there's an extremely sturdy "spring"

309
00:30:07,180 --> 00:30:09,170
ついてんだぜ (知ってた?)
attached to you! (Did you know?)

310
00:30:09,170 --> 00:30:11,710
おしつぶされそうな そんなときだって
Even in times when you feel crushed,

311
00:30:11,710 --> 00:30:13,960
ぐっ!とひざっ小僧に勇気をため
gather courage in your knees with a "Guts!",

312
00:30:13,960 --> 00:30:17,120
「いまだ!スタンバイ!OK!」その時を待つのさ
and wait for the moment: "Now! Standby! OK!"

313
00:30:17,120 --> 00:30:19,510
びゅ〜ら〜り〜ら〜 風が君を呼んでいるよ
Swish-swoosh, the wind is calling you.

314
00:30:19,510 --> 00:30:22,890
ボヨヨヨ〜ンと空へ 飛びあがってみよう
Bo-yo-yo-ing, let's leap up into the sky!

315
00:30:22,890 --> 00:30:25,660
ほら あの雲まで 手がとどきそう
Look, we can almost reach those clouds.

316
00:30:25,660 --> 00:30:29,680
ボヨヨヨ〜ンと 高く 飛び越えてゆこう
Bo-yo-yo-ing, let's leap high across them!

317
00:30:29,680 --> 00:30:33,970
虹のふもとで 笑顔で待ってる君がいる
At the foot of the rainbow, you're waiting with a smile.

318
00:30:33,970 --> 00:30:36,620
雲の切れ間を伸ばした
Stretching through the breaks in the clouds,

319
00:30:36,620 --> 00:30:39,960
涙は今 浮かぶ空に預けて
leave your tears to the floating sky right now.

320
00:30:39,960 --> 00:30:44,180
走り出すの ならんで見つけた
Start running, side by side, we found

321
00:30:44,180 --> 00:30:47,400
輝く光を 手に
a shining light in our hands,

322
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:51,400
わくわくしている
and we're so excited!

323
00:30:51,400 --> 00:30:56,548
今が一番大好き
Right now is what I love the most!

324
00:31:17,458 --> 00:31:21,868
続いて、そのまま次の曲 お聴きください。
Next, please enjoy our next song just as it is.

325
00:31:22,028 --> 00:31:23,068
さよならメモリーズ
Sayonara Memories.

326
00:31:31,304 --> 00:31:34,174
桜が咲くよ
The cherry blossoms are blooming

327
00:31:34,264 --> 00:31:36,684
見慣れたいつもの坂道に
on the familiar, usual hill road.

328
00:31:36,684 --> 00:31:39,514
ああ 別れを
Ah, saying goodbye—

329
00:31:39,514 --> 00:31:42,554
泣いて笑ったあのの日々が
those days we laughed and cried

330
00:31:42,654 --> 00:31:45,364
なんだか昨日のことのように
feel somehow like just yesterday.

331
00:31:45,464 --> 00:31:48,384
この道はそう 未来へ続く道
This road, yes, is a road leading to the future,

332
00:31:48,484 --> 00:31:50,574
そんな気がしたの
or so it felt to me.

333
00:31:57,264 --> 00:32:04,654
3月でね、卒業シーズンだから！ぜひ卒業ソングはあたごもとまでまって選びました！聴いててね！
Since March is graduation season! I specifically chose graduation songs for you! Listen closely!

334
00:32:18,944 --> 00:32:22,364
泣いて笑った
Those days we laughed and cried

335
00:32:22,364 --> 00:32:25,854
あの日々
together...

336
00:32:25,854 --> 00:32:30,148
なんだか昨日のことのように
feel somehow like just yesterday.

337
00:32:30,148 --> 00:32:34,148
この道はそう 未来へ続く道
This road, yes, is a road leading to the future,

338
00:32:34,148 --> 00:32:37,048
そんな気がしたの
or so it felt to me.

339
00:32:46,548 --> 00:32:54,448
例年より早い開花予想を キミは嬉しがってた
You were so happy about the cherry blossoms blooming earlier than usual.

340
00:32:54,648 --> 00:32:59,848
私は笑って「そうだね」って言った
I smiled and said, "That's right."

341
00:33:00,148 --> 00:33:04,948
あと少ししたらもう ここには戻れないのに
Even though in just a little while we won't be able to return here,

342
00:33:05,148 --> 00:33:10,548
言葉じゃうまく言えない想いを キミに打ち明けだとしたらなんて
if I were to confess the feelings I can't put into words...

343
00:33:10,648 --> 00:33:14,248
伝えよう 最初で最後に
I'll convey them, for the first and last time.

344
00:33:14,348 --> 00:33:19,248
いつか一緒に帰った道は 私にとって特別な思い出
The road we once walked home together is a special memory to me.

345
00:33:19,348 --> 00:33:22,448
忘れないよ さよならメモリーズ
I won't forget it. Goodbye, memories.

346
00:33:22,448 --> 00:33:26,548
春が来たら それぞれの道を行こう
When spring comes, let's walk our separate paths,

347
00:33:26,548 --> 00:33:30,048
また会える日を願って
hoping for the day we can meet again.

348
00:33:30,148 --> 00:33:33,448
さよなら 小さくつぶやいた
I whispered a quiet "Goodbye."

349
00:33:33,548 --> 00:33:37,248
空はあの日と変わらず 青くて
The sky was just as blue as that day,

350
00:33:37,248 --> 00:33:39,948
だから ちょっと泣けた
so I cried a little.

351
00:33:55,248 --> 00:33:58,548
また会える日を
Hoping for the day we can meet again,

352
00:33:58,548 --> 00:34:03,248
願って
praying...

353
00:34:03,348 --> 00:34:06,848
さよなら 小さくつぶやいた
I whispered a quiet "Goodbye."

354
00:34:06,948 --> 00:34:10,548
空はあの日と
The sky, just like that day,

355
00:34:10,548 --> 00:34:13,948
変わらず
remained unchanged

356
00:34:14,048 --> 00:34:17,348
青くて
and blue,

357
00:34:17,348 --> 00:34:20,348
だから ちょっと泣けた
so I cried a little.

358
00:34:23,148 --> 00:34:27,548
わざと遠回りしたの
I took a detour on purpose,

359
00:34:27,548 --> 00:34:31,948
少しでも長く キミの隣にいたくて
wanting to be by your side just a little longer.

360
00:34:32,048 --> 00:34:36,548
私はおどけて 「まちがえた」って言った
I acted playful and said, "I took a wrong turn."

361
00:34:36,548 --> 00:34:41,548
キミは笑う その顔がまぶしくて目をそらした
You smiled, and that face was so dazzling I averted my eyes.

362
00:34:41,648 --> 00:34:47,348
言葉じゃうまく言えない想いを 胸に抱いてこの道を歩いた
Holding feelings I couldn't put into words in my chest, I walked this road

363
00:34:47,448 --> 00:34:54,048
覚えてる あの時キミは 私の名前を呼んでくれた
and remember—back then, you called out my name.

364
00:35:00,256 --> 00:35:05,956
桜が咲くよ 見慣れたいつもの坂道に ああ 別れを
Cherry blossoms bloom on the familiar hill path... Ah, saying goodbye.

365
00:35:06,056 --> 00:35:09,956
泣いて笑ったあの日々なんだか昨日のことのように
Those days of crying and laughing feel just like yesterday.

366
00:35:10,056 --> 00:35:14,356
この道はそう 未来へ続く道 そんな気がしたのか
This road, yes, feels like a path leading to the future.

367
00:35:14,356 --> 00:35:18,956
例年より早い開花予想を君は喜んでいた
You were so happy the cherry blossoms bloomed earlier than usual.

368
00:35:19,056 --> 00:35:22,256
私は笑って「そうだね」って言った
I just smiled and said, "That's right."

369
00:35:22,256 --> 00:35:27,556
あと少ししたらもう ここには戻れないのに
Even though soon we won't be able to return here anymore.

370
00:35:30,556 --> 00:35:36,856
言葉じゃうまく言えない想いを君に打ち明けるとしたらなんて伝えよう
If I were to finally confess these words I can't put well...

371
00:35:36,856 --> 00:35:42,556
いつか一緒に帰った道は私にとって特別な思い出
The path we walked home together is such a special memory.

372
00:35:42,556 --> 00:35:46,056
忘れないよ さよならメモリーズ
I won't forget it, goodbye memories.

373
00:36:05,256 --> 00:36:09,856
春が来たら それぞれの道を また会える日を願って
When spring comes, each to our own path, wishing to meet again.

374
00:36:09,856 --> 00:36:12,856
さよなら 小さくつぶやいた
I whispered a small "goodbye."

375
00:36:12,856 --> 00:36:16,856
空はあの日と変わらず青くて だからちょっと泣けた
The sky was blue just like that day, so I cried a little.

376
00:36:16,856 --> 00:36:23,056
わざと遠回りしたの 少しでも長く君のそばにいたくて
I took a detour on purpose, wanting to be by your side longer.

377
00:36:23,056 --> 00:36:28,956
私はおどけて「まちがえた」って言った
I acted playfully and said, "I made a mistake."

378
00:36:29,056 --> 00:36:33,856
君は笑う その顔が眩しくて目をそらした
You smiled, and that face was so dazzling I looked away.

379
00:36:33,856 --> 00:36:39,956
言葉じゃうまく言えない想いを胸に抱いてこの道を歩いた
Holding feelings I can't express in my chest, I walked this road.

380
00:36:39,956 --> 00:36:45,856
覚えてるあの時君は 私の名前を呼んでくれた 二人夕暮れの帰り道で
I remember you calling my name on our way home in the twilight.

381
00:36:45,856 --> 00:36:51,556
忘れないよ さよならメモリーズ 出会えたこと感謝してる
I won't forget, goodbye memories. I'm so grateful we met.

382
00:36:51,856 --> 00:36:59,556
初めて見た満開の桜 あれからどれくらい 変われなんだろう
The first full-bloom cherry blossoms... how much have I changed since?

383
00:36:59,556 --> 00:37:05,556
一目見た時に思ったんだ この人のこと好きになりそうって
The moment I first saw you, I thought I'd fall in love with you.

384
00:37:05,556 --> 00:37:10,556
なんでか なんでかわかんないよ
I wonder why? I just don't know why.

385
00:37:10,556 --> 00:37:16,056
それからの毎日はとても楽しくて だけど同じくらいに 辛かったんだ
Every day after was so fun, but at the same time just as painful.

386
00:37:16,056 --> 00:37:21,856
ごめんね なんかうまく言えないよ だから私君となんて言うか
I'm sorry, I can't say it right. That's why, you and I...

387
00:37:21,856 --> 00:37:25,856
今のまま さよならしたくないの
I don't want to say goodbye just like this.

388
00:37:25,856 --> 00:37:29,056
友達のままでじゃ もう嫌なの
I don't want to stay just friends anymore.

389
00:37:29,056 --> 00:37:35,056
言おうと思ってた 私君の 君のことずっと ずっと 前から 好きでした ああ やっと言えた
I've loved you for so long. Ah, I finally said it.

390
00:37:39,256 --> 00:37:41,556
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

391
00:37:41,556 --> 00:37:46,556
アドレナリンとさよならメモリーズ 2曲続けてお聞きいただきましたーー！
You listened to Adrenaline and Sayonara Memories back to back!

392
00:37:48,056 --> 00:37:51,056
え、どうだった？
How was it?

393
00:37:51,056 --> 00:38:00,056
ちょっとさよならメモリーズは結構 結構結構練習したから いい感じにみんなの耳に聴こえてたらいいなと思っております
I practiced Sayonara Memories quite a lot, so I hope it sounded nice.

394
00:38:04,056 --> 00:38:08,556
やばすぎ！やばすぎか！やばすぎ嬉しいな ありがとう！
So amazing! So amazing! I'm so happy, thank you!

395
00:38:11,056 --> 00:38:18,556
えっとというわけで ここからは まだまだ歌ってまいりたいのですが
Well then, from here on, I'd like to keep singing more, but...

396
00:38:20,556 --> 00:38:25,556
その前にねねから 10ダハピの前にお知らせがあります！
Before that, I have an announcement from Nene before the 100k subscriber milestone!

397
00:38:31,556 --> 00:38:34,556
ちょっとお知らせ そしてもろていかな！
An announcement... and Monoteyakana!

398
00:38:39,556 --> 00:38:45,556
えっとというわけでちょっと明るいステージ このままでいっかな？
Well then, let's go with this bright stage, is this fine?

399
00:38:46,556 --> 00:38:55,556
もうねねの概要欄を見て ちょっとね あの冊ッチみたいな人もいるかもしれないのですが
You might have checked Nene's description and seen a booklet,

400
00:38:55,556 --> 00:39:06,056
ねねち初の公式ソログッズでまーーす！ でででででん！ドン！
Nenechi's first official solo goods are coming out! Ta-da-da-da-dam! Bam!

401
00:39:09,556 --> 00:39:17,556
ももすずねね 誕生日記念 2021 イェーーイ！
Momosuzu Nene Birthday Anniversary 2021! Yay!

402
00:39:18,056 --> 00:39:35,056
内容は ボイスのボイスとグッズ あと西沢5ミリ先生描き下ろしのアクリルパネルと
The contents include voice items, goods, and an acrylic panel illustrated by Nishizawa 5-mili...

403
00:39:44,056 --> 00:39:51,556
じゃあ見て見て！ あー かわいい！
Now look, look! Ah, so cute!

404
00:40:00,264 --> 00:40:03,564
じっくりねねの直筆文字のアクリルパネル、
An acrylic panel featuring Nene's handwritten text up close,

405
00:40:04,164 --> 00:40:08,564
そして、えー、えっとね、グッズの方が
and, um, let's see, as for the goods,

406
00:40:09,364 --> 00:40:14,564
ドン！「ねねプロ」社員ピンバッチ＆「ねねプロ」社員カードが
ta-da! The "Nene Pro" Employee Pin Badge & Card

407
00:40:14,664 --> 00:40:15,164
出ます！
are coming out!

408
00:40:15,164 --> 00:40:20,864
社員ピンバッチ見て！これ、あの、「ねねプロ」アクションの
Look at the pin badge! This is the official logo of Nene Pro Action,

409
00:40:20,864 --> 00:40:25,564
あの公式ロゴが出来上がりました！「ね」「ね」って書いてあるやつと、
that's been completed! The one with "Ne Ne" written on it,

410
00:40:25,564 --> 00:40:30,064
社員カードはなんと！ハズバンズナンバー入り！シリアルナンバーが入ります！
and the employee card has—guess what! Husbands number included with a serial number!

411
00:40:30,464 --> 00:40:38,864
みんなね、今まで勝手にナンバー乗ってたけど、とうとう、あの公式的に、あの番号が配られることになりました！
Everyone, up until now you've had numbers assigned on your own, but finally, officially, you're getting assigned numbers!

412
00:40:38,964 --> 00:40:43,164
イェーイ！イェーイ！
Yay! Yay!

413
00:40:43,764 --> 00:40:47,864
そう、社員証なんだけど、あのハズバンズ、ハズバンズナンバーって書いてあるんだよね。
Right, it's an employee ID, and it says "Husbands, Husbands Number" on it.

414
00:40:48,064 --> 00:40:51,564
ちょっとアップで見てほしい。あ、ちょっと待って、これじゃねえ、これじゃねえ。
I want you to see it close up. Ah, wait, not this, not this.

415
00:40:52,164 --> 00:40:54,064
えーっとこっち。よいしょ。
Um, this one. Here we go.

416
00:40:54,264 --> 00:40:59,064
ほら、どどどどどど！ほら、見て！ハズバンズナンバー入ります！
Look, ta-da-da-da-da! Look, see? The husband's number will be included!

417
00:41:00,064 --> 00:41:06,864
そして、なんと！裏面は、あ、ねねが提出物の嵐に遭っていた時何を書いていたのかと言うと、
And amazingly, on the back—when Nene was swarmed with assignments, what was she writing, you ask?

418
00:41:07,364 --> 00:41:17,564
社員カードの、いや、社員証の裏面にはなんとねねの、えー、オリジナルの描き下ろしのイラストとメッセージ！
On the back of the employee card—well, employee ID—there is Nene's original newly drawn illustration and message!

419
00:41:17,564 --> 00:41:22,564
そしてね、この裏面のデザインね、なんとねねがしました！いー！
And you know, Nene designed this back side herself! Yay!

420
00:41:23,064 --> 00:41:29,564
名前書くところ書いたので、みんなにそれぞれの名前を書いて持ち歩いてほしい！いェーイ！
Since there's a place to write your name, I want everyone to write their own name and carry it around! Yay!

421
00:41:33,364 --> 00:41:39,864
で、そんでもって、そんでもって、えー、全部セットっていうのがございまして、全部全部にすると、
And then, um, there is a "complete set", and if you get the all-in-one set,

422
00:41:41,864 --> 00:41:52,564
はい、グッズ＆ボイス全部セットの特典は、なんとねねの直筆サイン入り「西沢5ミリ先生描き下ろしイラストポストカード」＋特典ボイス！
yes, the perk for the goods & voice complete set is, amazingly, Nene's hand-signed postcard illustrated by Nishizawa 5-miri-sensei + bonus voice!

423
00:41:53,064 --> 00:41:56,564
見て、ポストカードの、ポストカードのこれ見て見て見て見て！
Look, look at this postcard, look, look, look, look!

424
00:41:57,064 --> 00:42:01,064
ほら、みんなの腕が生えてるー！
Look, everyone's arms are growing out of it!

425
00:42:01,564 --> 00:42:02,564
ええ！？
Eh?!

426
00:42:02,864 --> 00:42:07,564
いー！ねね、なでなでされてるんだけど！
Yay! Nene is getting her head patted!

427
00:42:08,064 --> 00:42:22,564
ねね、なぜなんでされてるんだけど、ライブ前のねねをね、応援、応援してくれているみんなをね、あの、あの、イメージでそんな感じにしていただきました！
Nene is getting head-patted, and I imagined everyone cheering on Nene before her live performance, and that's the kind of vibe I went with!

428
00:42:22,864 --> 00:42:32,064
えー、みんなね、ここにコラージュして自分の、自分の写真撮って自分でコラージュしてさ、まるで自分がなでなでしてるみたいな感じでやってほしい！
Everyone, collage yourselves into this, take your own photo, collage it yourself, and do it like you're the one patting her head!

429
00:42:36,264 --> 00:42:54,564
さあ、えー、グッズの紹介をしたところで、カートオープンが45分になります！あと2分で、えー、カートオープンで販売開始が21時となりますので、えー、21時まではね、ねねの配信見るでしょ？みんな、見て見て見てってね。
Now, having introduced the goods, the cart opens at :45! In 2 minutes, sales start at 21:00, so until 21:00 you'll watch Nene's stream, right everyone? Look, look, look, right?

430
00:42:56,064 --> 00:43:00,564
はい。えー、これスミッコ置いとこっかな。スミッコ置いとこっかな。
Yes. Um, I'll put this in the corner. I'll put this in the corner.

431
00:43:02,064 --> 00:43:06,564
どーん！すごいとこ！
Ta-da! What a place!

432
00:43:07,064 --> 00:43:15,064
はい、というわけで、えー、このテンションぶち上げのところで、次も初披露の曲聴いてもらいたいと思います。
Yes, so with that tension hyped all the way up, I'd like you to listen to another song being performed for the first time.

433
00:43:16,564 --> 00:43:22,064
それでは、聴いてください。春擬き。
Without further ado, please listen. Harumodoki.

434
00:43:34,631 --> 00:43:39,181
探しに行くんだ そこへ
I'm going to search for it, right there

435
00:43:52,612 --> 00:43:55,832
空欄を埋め 完成した定規
Filling in the blanks, a completed ruler

436
00:43:55,832 --> 00:43:58,402
正しい筈なのに
Even though it should be right,

437
00:43:58,622 --> 00:44:02,212
はらりひらり からまわる
Spinning around, fluttering away

438
00:44:02,392 --> 00:44:05,182
未来は歪で
The future is distorted

439
00:44:06,082 --> 00:44:11,522
僅かな亀裂から いくらでも綻んで
From a slight crack, fraying endlessly

440
00:44:11,732 --> 00:44:14,722
理想から逸れていくんだ
Straying away from the ideal

441
00:44:15,092 --> 00:44:19,062
ぬるま湯が すっと冷めていく音がしてた
I heard the lukewarm water quietly cooling down

442
00:44:20,662 --> 00:44:25,822
道を変えるのなら 今なんだ
If I'm going to change my path, now is the time

443
00:44:25,992 --> 00:44:29,682
こんなレプリカは いらない
I don't need a replica like this

444
00:44:30,052 --> 00:44:32,512
本物と呼べるものだけでいい
I only want what can be called the real thing

445
00:44:32,512 --> 00:44:37,542
探しに行くんだ そこへ
I'm going to search for it, right there

446
00:44:37,712 --> 00:44:44,472
「でもそれは よく出来たフェアリーテイルみたい。」
"But that sounds like a well-made fairytale."

447
00:44:44,822 --> 00:44:49,842
応えの消えた 空欄を見つめる
Gazing at the blank space where the answer disappeared

448
00:44:49,952 --> 00:44:56,352
埋めた筈なのに どうしても 解らない
Even though I filled it in, I still don't understand

449
00:45:00,392 --> 00:45:02,192
はい！はい！はい！はい！
Hai! Hai! Hai! Hai!

450
00:45:07,192 --> 00:45:09,372
答えの消えた
The answer vanished

451
00:45:10,032 --> 00:45:12,372
クルマを見つめる
as I gaze at the car.

452
00:45:12,512 --> 00:45:14,932
褒めたはずなのに
Even though I should have praised it,

453
00:45:15,372 --> 00:45:17,892
どうしてもわからない
I just don't understand why.

454
00:45:18,232 --> 00:45:22,992
綺麗な花は 大事に育てても
Even if you carefully raise a beautiful flower,

455
00:45:23,252 --> 00:45:29,092
遠慮ない速度で 簡単に関みにじられた
it gets ruthlessly and easily trampled.

456
00:45:29,912 --> 00:45:34,092
降り積もる白に
Over the piling white snow,

457
00:45:34,972 --> 00:45:38,292
小さな目 覆われてく
small buds are covered up.

458
00:45:39,212 --> 00:45:43,112
遠い 遠い春は
A distant, distant spring

459
00:45:46,532 --> 00:45:51,432
雪の知った 見えないものは どうしても
and the invisible things known to the snow, no matter what,

460
00:45:52,092 --> 00:45:58,492
記憶から薄れてしまうんだ 探しに行く
fade away from my memory. Even the place I'm going to search for

461
00:46:00,052 --> 00:46:04,632
場所さえも 見失う僕たちは
is lost, and we walk on

462
00:46:06,452 --> 00:46:11,232
気づかず目を踏む
without even noticing.

463
00:46:12,112 --> 00:46:17,212
想い出を頼りに作ってた 花はすぐ枯れた
The flowers I made relying on memories withered right away.

464
00:46:22,212 --> 00:46:29,112
足元には 気づかずに
Without even noticing what's at my feet...

465
00:46:38,272 --> 00:46:43,172
本物と呼べる 場所を
The place we can call the real thing—

466
00:46:49,032 --> 00:46:53,712
探しに行くのは きっと
searching for it is surely

467
00:46:59,112 --> 00:47:04,632
今なんだ こんなレプリカはいらない
happening now. I don't need any replica like this.

468
00:47:05,172 --> 00:47:10,652
本物と呼べるものだけでいい
I only want things that can be called the real thing.

469
00:47:11,032 --> 00:47:15,612
探しに行くから 君を
I'm going to search for you,

470
00:47:16,552 --> 00:47:22,632
ありがとう小さめ 見つけてくれたこと
thank you, little bud, for finding me.

471
00:47:25,112 --> 00:47:28,232
君は呟いた
You whispered.

472
00:48:00,392 --> 00:48:03,312
さて皆様！場所移動してねね！ぴょーん！
Now everyone! Moving locations, Nene! Pyon!

473
00:48:07,232 --> 00:48:13,272
ここからは ねねの 重大発表の時間です！イェーイ！
From here on is Nene's major announcement time! Yay!

474
00:48:17,552 --> 00:48:25,172
え、なんとなんと え、ここからは この曲は切り抜き禁止です！
Um, what- what, um, from here on, clips of this song are prohibited!

475
00:48:25,832 --> 00:48:29,192
え、なんでなんで？
Eh, why, why?!

476
00:48:30,192 --> 00:48:34,092
ああ、お水も飲んで整えさせて
Ah, let me drink some water and catch my breath.

477
00:48:36,172 --> 00:48:43,972
みんながね、重大発表ね、すごい楽しみにしてくれてて いろんなね、予想をね、Twitterでしてくれたりしてるの見て
Everyone was looking forward to the major announcement so much, and seeing you all making various guesses on Twitter,

478
00:48:44,272 --> 00:48:56,312
ねねもね、なんか、もうね、内容知ってるのに、なんかワクワクしちゃってて すごい、今から発表できるのが、とってもとってもとってもとってもとっても楽しみ！
even though Nene already knew what it was, I got so excited, and I'm super, super, super, super, super excited to announce it right now!

479
00:48:57,212 --> 00:48:59,172
そう、お水飲まなきゃ
Right, I gotta drink water.

480
00:49:02,232 --> 00:49:04,672
50万人おめでとう！え、50万人いったの？
Congrats on 500k! Eh, we hit 500k?!

481
00:49:05,172 --> 00:49:09,192
は、ハッピーバースデーお誕生日記念日かぶった！
Ha, happy birthday and anniversary overlapped!

482
00:49:11,072 --> 00:49:16,292
え、嬉しすぎ、無理無理無理！どうしよう、テンション爆上げで重大発表できそう！
Eh, too happy, impossible impossible! What should I do, my hype is through the roof, I can make the major announcement!

483
00:49:19,072 --> 00:49:24,172
それでは、ねねからの今日の重大発表
Well then, today's major announcement from Nene...

484
00:49:30,072 --> 00:49:36,272
発表します！さあ、3、2、1、ドン！
I'll announce it! 3, 2, 1, boom!

485
00:49:37,072 --> 00:49:47,072
桃鈴ねね 1stシングル「ねねねねねねね！大爆走」配信開始！オリジナル曲発表！イェーイ！
Momosuzu Nene's 1st single "Nenene Nenene Nenene! Daibakusou" releasing! Original song announcement! Yay!

486
00:49:57,072 --> 00:49:59,872
なんと、作詞・作曲・編曲 ねねの大好きな...
And what's more, lyrics, composition, and arrangement by Nene's favorite...

487
00:50:00,300 --> 00:50:03,100
ヒゲドライバーさんにお願いしましたー！
I asked Hige Driver-san!

488
00:50:06,200 --> 00:50:08,600
なんと！今日の日付が変わった、
And guess what! Today—well, the date changed,

489
00:50:08,900 --> 00:50:13,700
3月3日0時から配信開始になります！
and it will start streaming from midnight on March 3rd!

490
00:50:13,900 --> 00:50:17,400
なんとジャケットはねねの描き下ろし！
And the jacket art is completely drawn by Nene!

491
00:50:22,900 --> 00:50:25,800
頑張って描いた！ロゴもねねが作ったー！
I worked so hard drawing it! Nene even made the logo!

492
00:50:28,100 --> 00:50:30,900
え、なんで切り抜き禁止かと言うと、
Um, the reason why making clips is prohibited is because

493
00:50:31,000 --> 00:50:35,400
え、今からここで初発表、生初出しさせてもらうんですけど、
um, I'm going to premiere it right here live for the first time, but

494
00:50:35,500 --> 00:50:39,800
まだMVがね、えー完成してなくて、
the music video isn't finished yet, um,

495
00:50:40,000 --> 00:50:46,800
えー、それまでは切り抜きを禁止にしてMVを待ってもらいたい、
um, until then I'd like to prohibit clips and have everyone wait for the MV,

496
00:50:46,800 --> 00:50:48,900
そんな意志で、今回切り抜き禁止にさせていただきました。
so I decided to prohibit clip-making this time.

497
00:50:50,880 --> 00:50:56,880
こんなのまで作っちゃってね、フォトショップ触れるようになってからこんなのまで作っちゃってねね
I even made something like this! Ever since I learned to use Photoshop, I made this too.

498
00:50:59,280 --> 00:51:04,580
えーどんな曲だと思う？どんな曲だと思う？
Um, what kind of song do you think it is? What kind of song do you think?

499
00:51:04,680 --> 00:51:08,580
なんと、なんとなんとなんと、えーちょっと聞いてほしい
Guess what, guess what, um... I want you to listen.

500
00:51:09,280 --> 00:51:15,580
あいの手が入ってるんだけど、あいのてはね、ごきげんのみんなに応援してもらいました！
There are call-and-response parts, and I had everyone in a good mood cheer me on!

501
00:51:15,680 --> 00:51:21,080
みんなありがとう！すごいね、あのタイトなスケジュールだったんだけど
Thank you everyone! It was a really tight schedule, but

502
00:51:21,180 --> 00:51:25,880
みんなね、もう一言返事で「いいよ」って言ってくれて、あのすごいすごい良い曲になりました。
everyone replied with just a word saying 'Sure', and it became such an amazing song.

503
00:51:25,980 --> 00:51:30,080
もう嬉しすぎ！もうずっとね準備してて
I'm so happy! I've been preparing for this all along,

504
00:51:30,180 --> 00:51:37,080
もう発表、発表がね、あの楽しみで楽しみで、もうしょうがなくって
and I was just so overwhelmingly excited and looking forward to the announcement,

505
00:51:37,180 --> 00:51:43,080
もう今日ここで、あの歌えるのがもう本当にね、楽しみ！
that I'm just genuinely so excited to be able to sing it right here today!

506
00:51:43,180 --> 00:51:52,080
ちょっともうさ、なんか、なんか歓声上がっちゃってさ、泣きそうなんだけどさ、ちょっと、あのなるべくね、あのCD音源に近く歌えるように頑張りますので
I'm getting so emotional and about to cry, but I'll do my best to sing as close to the CD sound source as possible,

507
00:51:52,180 --> 00:52:00,080
えーと曲をね、ぜひ買ってほしいんだけど、まあ人にはいろいろそれぞれ事情があるからもし買えないよって人はねねのこの枠の、えーここで聞、聞いてほしい
um, I'd really love for you to buy the song, but people have different circumstances, so if you can't buy it, I want you to listen to it right here in Nene's stream,

508
00:52:00,280 --> 00:52:07,580
いっぱい覚えて、ほしい！みんなで歌ってほしい！でも、ごきげんのみんなに聴いてもらったら
learn it a lot, and sing it together! But once everyone in the chat listens to it,

509
00:52:07,680 --> 00:52:16,580
あのすっごい耳に残るって言ってもらえたからみんなね、耳にも残ってもらえるように頑張って頑張って今から歌いたいと
they told me it really stays in their ears, so I'm going to work hard so it stays in everyone's ears too as I sing it now.

510
00:52:16,680 --> 00:52:20,580
思います。はあ、緊張、緊張する。
Haa, I'm so nervous.

511
00:52:24,080 --> 00:52:33,580
そう、あのね、あの、あのみんなが曲を買ってくれたお金はねねが次のオリジナル曲作るための、費用に済ますので
Right, um, the money from everyone buying the song will be used by Nene as funds to create her next original song,

512
00:52:33,680 --> 00:52:44,080
ねねが今後もアイドル目指して、あの活動を続けていけるようによかったら曲は買ってほしいなっていうねねからのお願いですよろしくお願いします！
so that Nene can continue aiming to be an idol and keep active, I kindly ask that you please buy the song if you can. Thank you very much!

513
00:52:44,580 --> 00:52:47,580
というわけで歌っていきましょうか！
With that said, let's start singing!

514
00:52:47,880 --> 00:52:51,580
ねねねねねねねね、大爆走！
Nenenenenenenene, Daibakusou!

515
00:52:52,080 --> 00:52:55,580
あ、あせとりにきちゃった！
Ah, I started sweating!

516
00:52:55,880 --> 00:52:59,580
hhaa, 緊張する！
Haa, I'm so nervous!

517
00:53:00,080 --> 00:53:05,080
それでは聴いてください。
Now then, please listen.

518
00:53:05,580 --> 00:53:10,080
ねねの初のオリジナル曲。
Nene's very first original song.

519
00:53:15,180 --> 00:53:19,080
ななななな「な」じゃなくて
Nana nana, it's not "na"

520
00:53:19,480 --> 00:53:23,280
ににににに「に」じゃなくて
Nini nini, it's not "ni"

521
00:53:23,580 --> 00:53:28,080
ぬぬぬぬぬ「ぬ」じゃなくて
Nunu nunu, it's not "nu"

522
00:53:28,380 --> 00:53:34,080
ののののの「の」じゃなくて…
No nonono, it's not "no"...

523
00:53:35,880 --> 00:53:38,980
……「ね」！ (ねね！)
…Ooh, ne! (Nene!)

524
00:53:41,180 --> 00:53:43,930
ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ！
Yoisho, yoisho, yoisho, yoisho!

525
00:53:44,580 --> 00:53:46,080
(ねね！)
(Nene!)

526
00:53:46,580 --> 00:53:49,080
(ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ！)
Yoisho, yoisho, yoisho, yoisho!

527
00:53:49,280 --> 00:53:53,080
こんねね～！
Konnene~!

528
00:53:53,280 --> 00:53:55,280
ホロライブ 5期生 オレンジ担当
Hololive 5th generation's orange representative

529
00:53:55,280 --> 00:53:58,280
桃鈴ねね です！ (ねねち！)
Momosuzu Nene! (Nenechi!)

530
00:53:58,380 --> 00:54:00,080
異世界から来ました
I came from another world,

531
00:54:00,130 --> 00:54:01,930
アイドル志望の
aspiring to be an idol,

532
00:54:01,980 --> 00:54:04,280
新人vtuber (何だって！？)
a rookie VTuber! (What!?)

533
00:54:04,580 --> 00:54:07,880
まあ、とにかく明るくいきましょう！
Well, anyway let's stay cheerful and go!

534
00:54:08,080 --> 00:54:09,980
ちょっとくらい緊張したって、
Even if I get a little nervous,

535
00:54:10,080 --> 00:54:11,930
滑ったって
or slip up,

536
00:54:12,080 --> 00:54:14,580
「うおー！」って感じ でさ (うおー！)
I'll shout "Ohh!" like that (Ohh!)

537
00:54:14,680 --> 00:54:16,880
「どりゃあ！」ってやっていこう (どりゃあ！)
and keep going with "Toryaa!" (Toryaa!)

538
00:54:17,080 --> 00:54:19,580
あきらめの悪さは長所 だよね？
Being bad at giving up is a strong point, right?

539
00:54:19,780 --> 00:54:22,580
ねねねねねねねねねね (ね！)
Ne nenene nenene nenene! (Ne!)

540
00:54:22,780 --> 00:54:25,280
ねねねねねねねねねね (ね！)
Ne nenene nenene nenene! (Ne!)

541
00:54:25,580 --> 00:54:27,580
「はぁ～ん」なこともあるけど
Sometimes things make me go "Haa-an"

542
00:54:27,680 --> 00:54:32,080
悔しいこともあるけど大丈夫！
and sometimes things are frustrating, but I'll be alright!

543
00:54:32,280 --> 00:54:35,580
今日もしっかり、おめかしして
Today too, I'll dress up nicely,

544
00:54:35,880 --> 00:54:38,280
いつかはきっと「すーぱーねねちー！」
and someday I'll surely be "Super Nenechi!"

545
00:54:38,580 --> 00:54:40,080
ついてきてね
Come along with me!

546
00:54:40,280 --> 00:54:44,080
ねねねねねねね ねねねねねね
Ne nenene nenene ne nenene nenene

547
00:54:44,280 --> 00:54:47,580
ねねねねねねねね (ねね！)
Ne nenene nenene nenene! (Nene!)

548
00:54:47,780 --> 00:54:50,080
って、全力で行こう！
And go at full power!

549
00:54:50,280 --> 00:54:52,580
そんで全開で行こう！
Yep, let's go at full throttle!

550
00:54:52,780 --> 00:54:55,880
思い切りやれば何とかなるよ
If I give it my all, it'll work out somehow!

551
00:54:56,080 --> 00:54:57,280
ポンコツだっていい (ヨイショ！)
Even if I'm clumsy it's good! (Yoisho!)

552
00:54:57,480 --> 00:54:58,880
誤字ったっていい (ヨイショ！)
Even if I make a typo it's good! (Yoisho!)

553
00:55:00,088 --> 00:55:03,523
な な な な な 「 な 」 じゃなくて
Not na-na-na-na-na, it's "ne"!

554
00:55:03,523 --> 00:55:05,503
に に に に に 「 に 」 じゃなくて
Not ni-ni-ni-ni-ni, it's "ne"!

555
00:55:05,503 --> 00:55:07,503
ぬ ぬ ぬ ぬ ぬ 「 ぬ 」 じゃなくて
Not nu-nu-nu-nu-nu, it's "ne"!

556
00:55:07,503 --> 00:55:09,403
の の の の の 「 の 」 じゃなくて
Not no-no-no-no-no, it's "ne"!

557
00:55:09,403 --> 00:55:11,863
…… 「 ね 」 ！ （ ねね ！ ） （ ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ ！ ）
Nene! (Yoisho, yoisho, yoisho, yoisho!)

558
00:55:11,863 --> 00:55:13,343
（ ねね ！ ） （ ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ ！ ）
Nene! (Yoisho, yoisho, yoisho, yoisho!)

559
00:55:13,343 --> 00:55:17,743
こんねね ～ ！ （ こんねね ～ ！ ）
Konnene~! (Konnene~!)

560
00:55:17,743 --> 00:55:21,033
ホロライブ 5 期生 オレンジ 担当 桃鈴ねね です ！ （ ねね ち ～ ！ ）
I'm Hololive 5th Gen's orange representative, Momosuzu Nene! (Nenechi~!)

561
00:55:21,033 --> 00:55:29,963
異世界 から 来 ま した アイドル 志望 の 新人 ｖｔｕ ｂｅｒ （ 何 だって ？！ ） まぁ 、 とにかく 明るく いき ましょ ちょっ とくらい 緊張 し たって 、 滑っ た って 「 うおー ！ 」 って 感じ で さ （ うおー ！ ） 「 どりゃあ ！ 」 って やっ て いこ う （ どりゃあ ！ ） あきらめ の 悪さ は 長所 だ よ ね ？ ねねねねねねねねね （ ね ！ ） ねねねねねねねねね （ ね ！ ）
Coming from another world, dreaming of being an idol!

562
00:55:29,963 --> 00:55:32,503
「 はぁ ～ ん 」 な こと も ある けど
"Haa an" moments happen sometimes,

563
00:55:32,503 --> 00:55:35,413
悔しい こと も ある けど 大丈夫 ！
and things get tough, but it'll be alright!

564
00:55:35,413 --> 00:55:41,693
今日 も しっかり 、 おめかし し て いつか は きっと 「 すーぱーねね ち ！」 ついて き て ね ねねねねねねね ねねねねねねねね ねねねねねねねね （ ねね ！ ） ねねねねねね （ ね ！ ） ねねねね （ ね ！ ） ねねねねねね （ ねね ！ ）
Today I'll dress up nicely and do my best, and someday I'll be super nenechi!

565
00:55:41,693 --> 00:55:45,423
って 、 全力 で いこう ！
Let's go with all our power!

566
00:55:45,423 --> 00:55:51,613
そん で 全開 で いこう ！ 思い切り やれ ば なんとか なる よ
Full throttle! If I just go for it, things will work out!

567
00:55:51,613 --> 00:55:57,063
ポンコツ だって いい （ ヨイショ ！ ） 誤字 だっ て いい （ ヨイショ ！ ）
Clumsy is okay! (Yoisho!) Typos are okay! (Yoisho!)

568
00:55:57,063 --> 00:56:00,733
ただ 駆け抜け て いこ う ね
Let's just keep running through!

569
00:56:00,733 --> 00:56:04,373
ね ！ ね ！ ね ！ ね ！ 大爆走
It's a nene-nene-nene sprint!

570
00:56:04,373 --> 00:56:10,603
（ ねね ！ ） （ ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ ！ ）
Nene! (Yoisho, yoisho, yoisho, yoisho!)

571
00:56:10,603 --> 00:56:17,473
野菜 ジュース と 炭酸 と お菓子 、 そろえ て 準備 ｏｋ ！
Veggie juice, fizzy drinks, and sweets—ready to go!

572
00:56:17,473 --> 00:56:21,133
でも 朝 は 苦手 （ だ ね ！） 夜 も 苦手 （ だ ね ！）
Morning is tough! (That's right!) Night is tough! (That's right!)

573
00:56:21,133 --> 00:56:24,583
やっぱり 睡眠 って 、 大事 だ よ ね ？
Sleep really is important, huh?

574
00:56:24,583 --> 00:56:29,893
ねねねねねねねねねね （ ね ！ ）
Ne-ne-ne-ne-ne-ne-ne-ne-ne-ne! (Ne!)

575
00:56:29,893 --> 00:56:34,993
たくさん の 人 に 、 愛さ れ たい ！ ちゅちゅちゅ （ ちゅちゅちゅ ）
I wanna be loved by lots of people! Chu-chu-chu! (Chu-chu-chu!)

576
00:56:34,993 --> 00:56:40,083
大好き な みんな に 、 愛さ れ たい ！ ちゅちゅちゅ （ ちゅちゅちゅ ）
I wanna be loved by my beloved fans! Chu-chu-chu! (Chu-chu-chu!)

577
00:56:40,083 --> 00:56:46,943
そしたら なる ん だ 「 はいぱーねね ち ！ 」
And then I'll become hyper nenechi!

578
00:56:46,943 --> 00:56:52,573
やっちゃっ て ねねねねねねね ねねねねねねね ねねねねねねねね （ ねね ！ ）
Let's go for it, ne-ne-ne-ne-ne...

579
00:56:52,573 --> 00:56:57,573
って 、 全力 で いこう ！
Let's go with all our power!

580
00:56:57,573 --> 00:57:04,683
そん で 全開 で いこう ！ 歌 は 誰 に も 負け たく ない ん だ
Full throttle! I don't wanna lose to anyone at singing!

581
00:57:04,683 --> 00:57:11,603
大きな 声 で （ ヨイショ ！ ） あ 、 その 前 に （ ヨイショ ！ ） ちょっと トイレ 行っ て くる ね ～
A big shout out—wait, let me go to the restroom real quick!

582
00:57:11,603 --> 00:57:14,003
( restroom time ! ! ! )
(Restroom time!!!)

583
00:57:14,003 --> 00:57:17,483
（ ねね ！ ） （ ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ ヨイショ ！ ）
Nene! (Yoisho, yoisho, yoisho, yoisho!)

584
00:57:17,483 --> 00:57:23,043
ただいま ～ ！
(I'm back~!)

585
00:57:23,043 --> 00:57:26,643
それじゃあ 、 また ねね ～ ！ ばいば ～ い
And with that, mata nene~! Bye-bye!

